WEBVTT

00:05:28.783 --> 00:05:33.496
On his way out,
he stopped in the doorway,

00:05:33.537 --> 00:05:38.501
turned around and looked at me,
and completely calmly, he said,

00:05:40.127 --> 00:05:42.671
"When the Taliban come back,

00:05:42.671 --> 00:05:44.799
please promise

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.926
that you will burn my daughter's records.

00:05:48.594 --> 00:05:52.014
If the Taliban know
my daughter studies here,

00:05:52.014 --> 00:05:53.766
they will kill my family."

00:05:56.477 --> 00:05:59.647
Remember, this was 2019.

00:05:59.688 --> 00:06:00.815
Two years ago.